OL,5,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FA high call-out for ambulances has
OL,7,     Fresulted in paramedics queuing
OL,8,     Fwith patients in the corridor at
OL,9,     FBarnsley Casualty. The team must
OL,10,     Fdecide who is seen and who can
OL,11,     Fwait.
OL,12,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Natalia Spierings needs a
OL,14,     Fcolleague's help after losing the
OL,15,     Flocation of a lipoma in patient
OL,16,     FPauline's abdomen. Dr Emma
OL,17,     FMcMullen tackles a very visible
OL,18,     Fcyst on patient Steve's face.
